@miscellaneous-charges @regression-test @icm
Feature: Miscellaneous Charges — page load, add, validate, batch actions, and grid

  Payment Processing Miscellaneous Charges regression.
  Requires E2E_EMAIL and E2E_PASSWORD in .env.

  Background:
    Given I am logged into PieQ ICM for miscellaneous charges tests

  @miscellaneous-charges @page @TEST-001-Miscellaneous-Charges-PROD
  Scenario: T001-MSC-LST — Miscellaneous Charges page loads with correct heading
    When I open the miscellaneous charges page in misc charges
    Then the miscellaneous charges heading "Miscellaneous Charges" is displayed
    And the Add Miscellaneous Charge button is visible in misc charges

  @miscellaneous-charges @page @TEST-002-Miscellaneous-Charges-PROD
  Scenario: T002-MSC-GRD — Grid displays all required columns
    When I open the miscellaneous charges page in misc charges
    Then the miscellaneous charges grid shows all expected columns

  @miscellaneous-charges @page @TEST-003-Miscellaneous-Charges-PROD
  Scenario: T003-MSC-EMP — Empty grid shows No Records Found
    When I open the miscellaneous charges page in misc charges
    Then the miscellaneous charges grid shows the empty state or has records

  @miscellaneous-charges @page @TEST-004-Miscellaneous-Charges-PROD
  Scenario: T004-MSC-SRC — Search box placeholder text is displayed
    When I open the miscellaneous charges page in misc charges
    Then the miscellaneous charges search placeholder contains "Search by agent"

  @miscellaneous-charges @page @TEST-005-Miscellaneous-Charges-PROD
  Scenario: T005-MSC-FTR — Footer shows record count
    When I open the miscellaneous charges page in misc charges
    Then the miscellaneous charges footer shows record count

  @miscellaneous-charges @add @modal @TEST-006-Miscellaneous-Charges-PROD
  Scenario: T006-MSC-ADD — Add Miscellaneous Charge modal opens with all fields
    When I open the miscellaneous charges page in misc charges
    When I click the Add Miscellaneous Charge button in misc charges
    Then the miscellaneous charges modal heading is displayed
    And the miscellaneous charges Save button is disabled

  @miscellaneous-charges @add @modal @TEST-007-Miscellaneous-Charges-PROD
  Scenario: T007-MSC-TDT — Transaction Date defaults to today's date
    When I open the miscellaneous charges page in misc charges
    When I click the Add Miscellaneous Charge button in misc charges
    Then the miscellaneous charges transaction date defaults to today

  @miscellaneous-charges @add @validation @TEST-008-Miscellaneous-Charges-PROD
  Scenario: T008-MSC-SDI — Save is disabled when required fields are empty
    When I open the miscellaneous charges page in misc charges
    When I click the Add Miscellaneous Charge button in misc charges
    Then the miscellaneous charges Save button is disabled

  @miscellaneous-charges @add @modal @TEST-009-Miscellaneous-Charges-PROD
  Scenario: T009-MSC-CLS — Close button closes modal without saving
    When I open the miscellaneous charges page in misc charges
    When I click the Add Miscellaneous Charge button in misc charges
    When I click the modal close button in misc charges
    Then the miscellaneous charges modal is not visible

  @miscellaneous-charges @add @modal @TEST-010-Miscellaneous-Charges-PROD
  Scenario: T010-MSC-CNL — Cancel with unsaved changes shows confirmation
    When I open the miscellaneous charges page in misc charges
    When I click the Add Miscellaneous Charge button in misc charges
    And I fill misc charges amount with "250"
    And I fill misc charges description with "Test charge"
    When I click the modal Cancel button in misc charges
    Then the Cancel Changes confirmation dialog is displayed

  @miscellaneous-charges @add @modal @TEST-011-Miscellaneous-Charges-PROD
  Scenario: T011-MSC-KEP — Keep Editing returns to modal preserving values
    When I open the miscellaneous charges page in misc charges
    When I click the Add Miscellaneous Charge button in misc charges
    And I fill misc charges amount with "250"
    And I fill misc charges description with "Test charge"
    When I click the modal Cancel button in misc charges
    When I click Keep Editing in the Cancel Changes dialog
    Then the miscellaneous charges modal is still visible

  @miscellaneous-charges @add @modal @TEST-012-Miscellaneous-Charges-PROD
  Scenario: T012-MSC-CFD — Confirming Cancel discards changes and closes modal
    When I open the miscellaneous charges page in misc charges
    When I click the Add Miscellaneous Charge button in misc charges
    And I fill misc charges amount with "250"
    And I fill misc charges description with "Test charge"
    When I click the modal Cancel button in misc charges
    When I click Cancel in the Cancel Changes dialog
    Then the miscellaneous charges modal is not visible

  @miscellaneous-charges @add @save @TEST-013-Miscellaneous-Charges-PROD
  Scenario: T013-MSC-SAV — Valid miscellaneous charge saves and appears in grid
    When I open the miscellaneous charges page in misc charges
    When I save a miscellaneous charge for agent "90058" with amount "250" and description "E2E test charge"
    Then the miscellaneous charges grid shows saved charge

  @miscellaneous-charges @add @edit @modal @TEST-020-Miscellaneous-Charges-PROD
  Scenario: T020-MSC-EDT — Edit a misellaneous charge and update fields
    When I open the miscellaneous charges page in misc charges
    When I click the Add Miscellaneous Charge button in misc charges
    And I fill misc charges amount with "250"
    And I fill misc charges description with "Original charge"
    And I click the modal Save button in misc charges
    Then the miscellaneous charges grid shows saved charge
    And I click the first row in miscellaneous charges grid
    And I fill misc charges amount with "100"
    And I fill misc charges description with "Updated charge"
    When I click the modal Save button in misc charges
    Then the miscellaneous charges grid shows updated charge

  @miscellaneous-charges @batch @TEST-014-Miscellaneous-Charges-PROD
  Scenario: T014-MSC-PRC — Process button is disabled when no rows are selected
    When I open the miscellaneous charges page in misc charges
    Then the Process button is disabled in misc charges
    And the Cancel batch button is disabled in misc charges

  @miscellaneous-charges @batch @TEST-015-Miscellaneous-Charges-PROD
  Scenario: T015-MSC-SLC — Selecting a row enables batch buttons
    When I open the miscellaneous charges page in misc charges
    And I select the first row in miscellaneous charges grid
    Then the Process button is enabled in misc charges
    And the Cancel batch button is enabled in misc charges

  @miscellaneous-charges @batch @TEST-016-Miscellaneous-Charges-PROD
  Scenario: T016-MSC-SAL — Select-all checkbox selects all grid rows
    When I open the miscellaneous charges page in misc charges
    When I click the select-all checkbox in miscellaneous charges
    Then the Process button is enabled in misc charges

  @miscellaneous-charges @batch @TEST-021-Miscellaneous-Charges-PROD
  Scenario: T021-MSC-DEL — Delete a miscellaneous charge
    When I open the miscellaneous charges page in misc charges
    And I select the first row in miscellaneous charges grid
    When I click the Cancel batch button in misc charges
    Then the Cancel batch button is enabled in misc charges
    And the Process button is enabled in misc charges
    When I click the Delete button on the first row in misc charges
    Then the miscellaneous charge is deleted
    And the grid shows No Records Found or reduced count

  @miscellaneous-charges @page @toolbar @TEST-022-Miscellaneous-Charges-PROD
  Scenario: T022-MSC-SRCH — Search box filters results by query
    When I open the miscellaneous charges page in misc charges
    When I fill misc charges search with "90058"
    Then the miscellaneous charges grid shows filtered results for agent "90058"
    And the miscellaneous charges search placeholder contains "Search by agent"

  @miscellaneous-charges @page @toolbar @TEST-023-Miscellaneous-Charges-PROD
  Scenario: T023-MSC-STF — Status filter shows specific status
    When I open the miscellaneous charges page in misc charges
    And I select the first row in miscellaneous charges grid
    Then the Process button is enabled in misc charges
    And the Cancel batch button is enabled in misc charges
    When I filter misc charges status by "Draft"
    Then the miscellaneous charges grid shows only Draft status charges

  @miscellaneous-charges @page @toolbar @TEST-017-Miscellaneous-Charges-PROD
  Scenario: T017-MSC-TLB — Export, Refresh, and Columns toggle are visible
    When I open the miscellaneous charges page in misc charges
    Then the miscellaneous charges export button is visible
    And the miscellaneous charges refresh button is visible
    And the miscellaneous charges columns toggle is visible

  @miscellaneous-charges @add @validation @TEST-018-Miscellaneous-Charges-PROD
  Scenario: T018-MSC-AMT — Amount 0 keeps Save disabled
    When I open the miscellaneous charges page in misc charges
    When I click the Add Miscellaneous Charge button in misc charges
    And I fill misc charges amount with "0"
    And I fill misc charges description with "Test"
    Then the miscellaneous charges Save button is disabled

  @miscellaneous-charges @add @validation @TEST-019-Miscellaneous-Charges-PROD
  Scenario: T019-MSC-NEG — Negative amount keeps Save disabled
    When I open the miscellaneous charges page in misc charges
    When I click the Add Miscellaneous Charge button in misc charges
    And I fill misc charges amount with "-50"
    And I fill misc charges description with "Test"
    Then the miscellaneous charges Save button is disabled
